* Forward Flow

# Working Directory  --->  git add     --->  Staging Area
# Staging Area       --->  git commit  --->  Local Repository
# Local Repository   --->  git push    --->  Remote Repository




* Reverse Flow

# Staging Area       --->  git restore --->  Working Directory
# Local Repository   --->  git reset   --->  Working Directory / Staging Area
# Remote Repository  --->  git pull    --->  Local Repository & Working Directory


+---------------------+           git add            +------------------+
|  Working Directory  |  ------------------------->  |   Staging Area   |
+---------------------+                              +------------------+
          ^        ^                                          |
          |        |                 git commit               |
git restore        +------------------------------------------+
          |                                                   |
          |                          git push                 v
+---------------------+  ------------------------->  +------------------+
|  Local Repository   |                              | Remote Repository|
+---------------------+  <-------------------------  +------------------+
                                     git pull
